{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/LeoGuoLabs/status/2111170314067701856","id":"2111170314067701856","text":"Sam Altman expected GPT-4 to disrupt software businesses much faster. He underestimated how strongly people stick with familiar tools and suppliers.\n\nI think that’s a useful challenge for AI builders: make one everyday task easier without asking people to redesign their whole workday. Give them a reason to use it again tomorrow.","raw_text":{"text":"Sam Altman expected GPT-4 to disrupt software businesses much faster. He underestimated how strongly people stick with familiar tools and suppliers.\n\nI think that’s a useful challenge for AI builders: make one everyday task easier without asking people to redesign their whole workday. Give them a reason to use it again tomorrow.","display_text_range":[0,330],"facets":[]},"author":{"screen_name":"LeoGuoLabs","url":"https://x.com/LeoGuoLabs","id":"2089926964954144768","followers":21,"following":103,"likes":3,"media_count":94,"name":"Leo Guo","description":"Previously a senior C/C++ engineer in telecom. Now exploring AI and emerging tech, sharing useful tools and an engineering perspective.","raw_description":{"text":"Previously a senior C/C++ engineer in telecom. Now exploring AI and emerging tech, sharing useful tools and an engineering perspective.","facets":[]},"location":"Singapore, Hong Kong","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2089926964954144768/1791775643","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2089933102760214528/wgwr7axH_200x200.jpg","joined":"Wed Aug 19 04:18:29 +0000 2026","protected":false,"website":null,"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"avatar_color":null},"replies":1,"retweets":0,"likes":1,"bookmarks":0,"quotes":0,"created_at":"Fri Oct 16 19:00:01 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1792177201,"views":5,"is_note_tweet":true,"community_note":null,"lang":"en","replying_to":null,"replying_to_status":null,"quote":{"url":"https://x.com/vikktorrrre/status/2110821312318865692","id":"2110821312318865692","text":"Sam Altman: We’ve all been too ambitious on AI timelines, even with this incredible technology.\n\n“I thought when we got to GPT-4, there was going to be much more disruption in software right away.”\n\n“I was wrong about the speed.”\n\n“The economy just has so much inertia. People keep doing the same things and buying from the same companies.”\n\n“AI is one of the most incredible technologies humanity has ever invented, but society and the economy will adapt more slowly.”\n\n“Changing behavior is just much harder than tech nerds realize.”","raw_text":{"text":"Sam Altman: We’ve all been too ambitious on AI timelines, even with this incredible technology.\n\n“I thought when we got to GPT-4, there was going to be much more disruption in software right away.”\n\n“I was wrong about the speed.”\n\n“The economy just has so much inertia. People keep doing the same things and buying from the same companies.”\n\n“AI is one of the most incredible technologies humanity has ever invented, but society and the economy will adapt more slowly.”\n\n“Changing behavior is just much harder than tech nerds realize.”","display_text_range":[0,535],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[277,300],"id":"2110819461099843584","display":"pic.x.com/RTBsQ38Fe6","original":"https://t.co/RTBsQ38Fe6","replacement":"https://x.com/vikktorrrre/status/2110821312318865692/video/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"vikktorrrre","url":"https://x.com/vikktorrrre","id":"1785805702935515137","followers":11336,"following":1879,"likes":175640,"media_count":17087,"name":"Veee","description":"AI/TECH","raw_description":{"text":"AI/TECH","facets":[]},"location":"AGI","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1785805702935515137/1768702625","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2012714142877044736/_6qWAbnU_200x200.jpg","joined":"Wed May 01 22:57:37 +0000 2024","protected":false,"website":{"url":"http://veee.a